  "details": "[Description]\n\nCurrently, raising a Float parameter using parameter driver can raise it past the normal 1 or -1 total. \n\n[Steps to reproduce]\n\n1: make an animation state that can be triggered over and over, with parameter driver ADD to the float parameter. \n\n2: Notice the Float value raising above the cap.\n\n[Intended Result]\n\nThe float value of a parameter can only be a value between -1 and 1.",
